    "updated_at": "2023-03-17T13:15:03Z",
    "body": "Heya @nt1m - we do have use counters at https://chromestatus.com/metrics/feature/popularity#PopoverTypeAuto (and see the two below it. Usage is basically zero... but maybe the UseCounters are only active for folks with chrome://flags/#enable-experimental-web-platform-features on? (I dunno, maybe @mfreed7 or @josepharhar would know). \r\n\r\nI'm happy to attempt outreach, but would need more details about the report - feel free to shoot me an email if that would be helpful.\r\n\r\n",
