    "created_at": "2023-03-17T15:43:04Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-03-17T15:43:04Z",
    "body": "Thanks for raising this! I've had popover enabled at 50% of Canary/Dev/Beta versions of Chrome for the last 3-4+ months, to suss these out. There was one [other issue like this](https://crbug.com/1410102), and after some quick outreach, the site fixed their bug. Other than that, I haven't seen any other bugs, so I'm fairly confident this is a low frequency issue.\r\n\r\nTo be very clear, this is a site bug. Custom attributes [must start with `data-`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dom.html#custom-data-attribute) to avoid clashes with platform features like this. An easy recommended fix for the site is to just rename `popover` to `data-popover`.\r\n\r\nDoes anyone have a good contact at the broken site? I'm happy to try to reach out to help them.\r\n",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
