    "updated_at": "2023-05-26T19:50:50Z",
    "body": "> We found out that sites using older versions of this framework are affected: [valor-software/ngx-bootstrap#6544](https://github.com/valor-software/ngx-bootstrap/issues/6544)\r\n\r\nCorrection: no fix was ever done in the framework itself, but framework consumers are encouraged to move from `popover=` to `[popover]=` to avoid the clash.",
