    "updated_at": "2023-07-13T19:35:46Z",
    "body": "I think we can close this issue. Chrome shipped Popover in M114, and while there were a few issues (including the ones mentioned above), they were all resolved on the site side by avoiding non-`data-`-prefixed attributes.",
